        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Let’s tile again!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893930/extras/b08ccbe6d0c0ecb9d1019a3d3f3b8b3e.avif?t=1788052097\" width=192 height=221 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just the tile shape has changed⁉ Back again—with almost nothing different!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can a single type of tile cover a plane non-periodically?<br>This long-unsolved mystery is known as the “Einstein Problem,” from the German <i>ein stein</i> meaning “one stone.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2022, David Smith discovered the elusive einstein tile!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Creative Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagination is infinite.<br>Freely tile the plane and create your own original background.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893930/extras/6131931d968595d68cd168feee2d652a.poster.avif?t=1788052097\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893930/extras/6131931d968595d68cd168feee2d652a.webm?t=1788052097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893930/extras/6131931d968595d68cd168feee2d652a.mp4?t=1788052097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzle Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill the given frame using einstein tiles.<br>It’s like a jigsaw puzzle—with no picture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893930/extras/4ec393b508c461e11b374765347be15c.poster.avif?t=1788052097\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893930/extras/4ec393b508c461e11b374765347be15c.webm?t=1788052097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893930/extras/4ec393b508c461e11b374765347be15c.mp4?t=1788052097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Disclaimer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may freely use footage of this game on YouTube, livestreams, or websites—whether for profit or not</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Let’s tile again!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893930/extras/b08ccbe6d0c0ecb9d1019a3d3f3b8b3e.avif?t=1788052097\" width=192 height=221 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just the tile shape has changed⁉ Back again—with almost nothing different!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can a single type of tile cover a plane non-periodically?<br>This long-unsolved mystery is known as the “Einstein Problem,” from the German <i>ein stein</i> meaning “one stone.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2022, David Smith discovered the elusive einstein tile!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Creative Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagination is infinite.<br>Freely tile the plane and create your own original background.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893930/extras/6131931d968595d68cd168feee2d652a.poster.avif?t=1788052097\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893930/extras/6131931d968595d68cd168feee2d652a.webm?t=1788052097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893930/extras/6131931d968595d68cd168feee2d652a.mp4?t=1788052097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzle Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill the given frame using einstein tiles.<br>It’s like a jigsaw puzzle—with no picture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893930/extras/4ec393b508c461e11b374765347be15c.poster.avif?t=1788052097\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893930/extras/4ec393b508c461e11b374765347be15c.webm?t=1788052097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893930/extras/4ec393b508c461e11b374765347be15c.mp4?t=1788052097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Disclaimer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may freely use footage of this game on YouTube, livestreams, or websites—whether for profit or not</p>",
